+### Post search and trending
+
+The feed page shows a search box that filters posts by title substring. The
+search box is available to every visitor, including non-logged users. Next to
+the feed, a trending sidebar lists the most liked posts so visitors can discover
+popular content.
+
 ### Simple usage instructions
 
 1. Click `profile` icon at footer > signup > enter email and password > changes to login modal > enter email and password used to signup
